  To determine in vivo recovery (IVR):
   ●   Measure the baseline plasma VWF:RCo level
   ●   Infuse a calculated dose (international units/kg) of VWF:RCo IV at "time 0"
   ●   At "time+30 minutes", measure the plasma VWF:RCo level
