  Advate®: 20 to 40 international units/kg IV every other day (3 to 4 times weekly). Alternatively, an every third day dosing regimen targeted to
  maintain factor VIII trough levels to 1% or greater may be used. Adjust the dose based on clinical response Xyntha®

  12 years or older: 30 international units/kg IV 3 times weekly; adjust dose or frequency based on clinical response 3
  Younger than 12 years: 25 international units/kg IV every other day; adjust dose or frequency based on clinical response. More frequent or
  higher doses may be required because of higher clearance in children younger than 12 years 3', 'Recombinant antihemophilic factor is indicated for control 3 ,2 , on-demand treatment 3 and prevention 2 of bleeding episodes, perioperative
