   Types 1, 2, and 3 as IPV from a different manufacturer (IPOL®, Sanofi Pasteur). The immuno-
   logic responses following 3 doses of DTaP-HepB-IPV were generally similar to those following 3
   doses ', 'Routine vaccination; diphtheria, tetanus, pertussis, hepatitis B, poliovirus
   6 weeks to less than 7 years: 5 mL/dose IM in the anterolateral thigh to complete a 3-dose
   series at 2, 4, and 6 months of age. Preferred interval between doses is 8 weeks but may be as
