   needles provided • Remove the filter needle from the syringe and replace with an appropriate injection or but-
   terfly needle for administration • If vacuum is lost in the antithrombin III vial during reconstitution, use a sterile syringe to re-
   move the sterile water from the diluent vial and inject it into the antithrombin III vial, directing
   the stream of fluid against the wall of the vial • Visually inspect for particulate matter and discoloration prior to administration, whenever so-
