   Once maintenance dose has been achieved, monitor antithrombin level approximately every
   24 hours as needed • Measure functional antithrombin plasma levels using amidolytic assays using chromogenic
   substrates or by clotting assays; do not use immunoassays as they may not detect all heredi-
