   gluteal injections (on opposite sides or at least 2 cm apart) during the same visit; initiate injec-
   tion on last day of oral lead-in and administer the second initiation injection 1 month later Second of 2 initiation injections: Cabotegravir 600 mg IM and rilpivirine 900 mg IM as sepa-
   rate gluteal injections (on opposite sides or at least 2 cm apart) during the same visit; adminis-
   ter the second initiation injection 1 month after the first initiation injection (may be given up to
   7 days before or after the date the patient is scheduled to receive the second injection) Continuation injection: Cabotegravir 600 mg IM and rilpivirine 900 mg IM as separate gluteal
