   tions 2 months after the second of 2 initiation injections; patients may be given continuation
   injections up to 7 days before or after the date the patient is scheduled to receive monthly in-
   jections Planned missed injection: If a patient plans to miss a scheduled injection visit by more than 7
   days, administer daily oral therapy for up to 2 months to replace 1 missed injection visit.
