      are initiating a regimen that contains ARV drugs with activity against HBV (ie, lamivudine,
      emtricitabine, tenofovir alafenamide, or tenofovir disoproxil fumarate).
      ¶¶ Conduct HLA-B*5701 on entry prior to initiating abacavir if not done previously.
