   Histoplasmosis
   Moderately Severe to Severe Disseminated Disease, Induction: 3 to 5 mg/kg IV once daily
   for at least 2 weeks, followed by consolidation therapy with itraconazole for 12 months.
   Alternatively, if itraconazole is not tolerated may use liposomal amphotericin B for 4 to 6
