   onds until corneal thickness is at least 400 microns. May perform irradiation once yellow flare
   is observed and corneal thickness is at least 400 microns 1 ,2 .

   During the entire irradiation period (30 minutes), administer 2 drops of Photrexa® Viscous ev-
