   Limitations of Use

   More rilpivirine-treated participants with no antiretroviral treatment history with HIV-1 RNA
   greater than 100,000 copies/mL at the start of therapy experienced virologic failure (HIV-1 RNA
   50 copies/mL or greater) compared with rilpivirine-treated participants with HIV-1 RNA 100,000
   copies/mL or less Administration
   Administer with food 1 containing at least 500 calories (protein drink alone is not sufficient)', 'Common (greater than 2%)
