   6 months to 23 months; routine vaccination
   • Unvaccinated: Give 2-dose initial series of Moderna COVID-19 vaccine (2025 to 2026 formula).
   Dose is 25 mL IM; administer second dose at least 4 to 8 weeks after first dose 1/9
• Previously vaccinated with 1 dose of any Moderna COVID-19 vaccine: Complete the 2-dose series
   by administering 1 dose (0.25 mL) of Moderna COVID-19 vaccine (2025 to 2026 formula) IM;
   administer at least 4 to 8 weeks after first dose 2 years to 11 years; vaccination in special situations
   • Any vaccination status: Give 1 dose (0.25 mL) IM of Spikevax® (2025 to 2026 formula) at least 8
