   tus, genetic screening for the HLA-B*5701 allele is required to reduce the risk of hypersensitiv-
   ity reaction 3 ,4 .
   Hepatic function should be monitored closely with both clinical and laboratory follow-up for at
   least several months in patients who discontinue abacavir, dolutegravir, and lamivudine and
