   Serious cardiopulmonary reactions, including fatalities, have occurred uncommonly during or
   following perflutren-containing microsphere administration. Most serious reactions occur
   within 30 minutes of administration.
   Assess all patients for the presence of any condition that precludes perflutren protein type A
   microsphere administration.

   Always have resuscitation equipment and trained personnel readily available Monitoring
