   Renal excretion, sodium nitrite: Approximately 40% of sodium nitrite is excreted unchanged Renal excretion, sodium thiosulfate: Approximately 20% to 50% of sodium thiosulfate is ex-
   creted unchanged through the kidney. A small proportion of oxidized sodium thiosulfate (sul-
   fate) and sulphur compounds are excreted through the kidneys Renal clearance, thiocyanate: The renal clearance of thiocyanate, a nontoxic form of cyanide
   after sodium thiosulfate donates a sulfur, was inversely proportional to creatinine clearance Half-life

   Sodium thiosulfate: Half-life was 20 minutes after a dose of 1 gram IV; half-life increased to
   182 minutes after a dose of 150 mg/kg in healthy adult men 1

