   mean half-life of 5 hours 6 , Ibuprofen is highly protein bound (99%). Metabolized into (+)-2-4''-(2-hydroxy-2-methyl-propyl)
   phenyl propionic acid and (+)-2-4''-(2-carboxypropyl) phenyl propionic acid. Ibuprofen and me-
   tabolites are excreted in urine, with approximately 15% eliminated as unchanged drug; plasma
   half-life is 2 hours 6 ,7 .'),
