   Limitations of Use

   The fixed-dose combination product of mometasone furoate/formoterol fumarate is not indi-
   cated for relief of acute bronchospasm 2

   Administration
   •Prime the inhaler before the first use and anytime the inhaler has not been used for more
   than 5 days. Release 4 test sprays into the air away from the face, and shake well before each
   spray •Use the mometasone furoate/formoterol fumarate canister only with the mometasone
   furoate/formoterol fumarate actuator. Do not use the mometasone furoate/formoterol fu-
   marate actuator with any other inhalation product, and do not use actuators from other prod-
   ucts with the mometasone furoate/formoterol fumarate canister •Do not remove canister from actuator because the correct amount of medication may not be
