   not be used and should be discarded 1 , • Do not operate any part of the Vialmix RFID(R) and Definity(R) or Definity(R) RT RFID-tagged
   vials within 6 inches (15 cm) of a pacemaker and/or defibrillator 1 ,2 .

   • The maximum mechanical index of the ultrasound device is 3 in pediatric patients 3 ,4 .

