   guard flat at a 90-degree angle against the skin and keep the viewing window visible. Press
   down firmly until you cannot see the orange needle guard. When injecting, you will hear a click
   telling you the injection has started; press and hold the prefilled pen for 15 seconds until there
   is a second click telling you the injection has finished. The orange plunger will move down in
   the viewing window during the injection and fill the window when finished. Lift pen straight up
