  • Transfer to pre-calibrated prescription bottle; use 5 mL aliquot of suspension vehicle to rinse mortar and add to bottle; repeat
  once.
  • Add sufficient quantity of suspension vehicle to make 30 mL.

  • Shake thoroughly to evenly disperse suspension; label with "Shake well."
  • Stable at room temperature or under refrigeration (2 to 8°C) for up to 2 months.

