   negative. Note that latent TB test may be falsely negative in patients receiving etanercept-szzs • Monitor patient closely for signs and symptoms of infection during and after therapy • Perform periodic skin examinations in all patients at risk of skin cancer • Monitor patients with heart failure for worsening of congestive heart failure', '', 'Pharmacology
