   addition.

   • Transfer contents of mortar to bottle and add enough vehicle to reach a final volume of 120
   mL.
   • Label bottle with "Shake well before using" and "Protect from light". acetaZOLAMIDE 25
   mg/mL oral liquid was stable for 60 days when protected from light.

