   paste.
   • Add SyrSpend SF PH4 ®, in geometric proportions, mixing well after each addition, to close
   to total volume.

   • Transfer suspension to a light-resistant, low-actinic plastic container.

• Add SyrSpend SF PH4 ®, in geometric proportions, mixing well after each addition, to a final
   volume of 300 mL.

   • Label the container with "Shake well before using" and "Protect from light."

   • Stable for 90 days under refrigeration (2° to 8°C) or at room temperature (20° to 25°C).

