   Monitoring
   Therapeutic Physical Monitoring
   Assess pain in critically ill pediatric patients via observational pain assessment tools rather
   than vital signs alone. Use of Faces, Legs, Activity, Cry, and Consolability (FLACC) or COMFORT-
