   necessary. Mycophenolate mofetil tablets should not be crushed; mycophenolate mofetil cap-
   sules should not be opened or crushed. Avoid inhalation or direct contact with the oral sus-
   pension or with the dry powder contained in capsules or powder for oral suspension 3 , Do not mix the oral suspension with other medications or any liquids prior to administration
