   age) with recurrent severe LRTIs experienced fewer episodes of progression to severe LRTIs
   with early administration of azithromycin compared with placebo (HR, 64 (95% CI, 41 to 98)) in a double-blind, randomized, study (n=0.607). Azithromycin 12 mg/kg/day for 5 days or
