   t', 'Neoral® and Gengraf® (modified cycloSPORINE capsules or solution for microemulsion)
   are not bioequivalent to oral Sandimmune® (cycloSPORINE capsules or solution, USP)
   and cannot be used interchangeably; Neoral® and Gengraf® have increased bioavail-
