   Note: A 5 mg/mL oral suspension is commercially available.

   2 mg/mL oral solution (100 mL) with simple syrup 22 :
   • Empty powder from the number of indomethacin capsules required to achieve 200 mg into a
   mortar.

• Wet indomethacin powder with a small amount of 10% (v/v) solution of alcohol in water and
   use a pestle to form a smooth paste.

