   Preparation
   Extemporaneous Oral Compounds
   Note: 2 mg/mL (60 mL) and 5 mg/mL (120 mL) oral solutions are commercially available. 5 mg/mL Oral suspension (300 mL) in SyrSpend SF PH4 42
   • Weigh out 750 mg of methotrexate active pharmaceutical ingredient and triturate into a fine
   powder using a mortar and pestle.
   • Add a small amount of SyrSpend SF PH4 to wet the powder and mix into a fine paste.
   • Add SyrSpend SF PH4 in geometric portions almost to volume, mixing thoroughly after each
   addition.
   • Add sufficient SyrSpend SF PH4 to bring final volume to 300 mL, and mix well.
   • Transfer to a low-actinic prescription bottle.

• Label the container with "Shake well before using."
   • Stable for 90 days at room temperature (20 to 25°C) or under refrigeration (2 to 8°C).

   2 mg/mL Oral solution (30 mL) with OraSweet 43
   • Dissolve 6 g of sodium bicarbonate in water either in a mortar or beaker with a magnetic
   stirrer.

   • Slowly add 5 mL of Ora Sweet.
   • Continue to mix while adding 4 mL of methotrexate for injection 500 mg/20 mL.

   • Add sufficient sterile water for a final volume of 30 mL.
   • Stable for 120 days when stored at 4 or 25 degrees C
   2 mg/mL Oral solution (20 mL) with chloroform water solution and saccharin in cherry-
   flavored glycol or aqueous base 44,45

   • Prepare a stock diluent solution: Mix 250 mL of 05% saccharin in cherry-flavored glycol
   or aqueous base. Add 20 g sodium bicarbonate. Add a sufficient quantity of chloroform wa-
   ter solution* to a final volume of 1 L.
   • To prepare a methotrexate 40 mg/20mL solution, use 6 mL of methotrexate from a 25
   mg/mL methotrexate preservative-free vial, bring to a total of 20 mL with stock diluent
   solution.
   • Stable for 1 month at room temperature and in the refrigerator in both clear and brown glass
   bottles .
   • *Chloroform water solution: Add a sufficient quantity of distilled water to 5 mL of pharma-
   ceutical grade chloroform water to a volume of 1 L. 5 mg/mL Oral suspension (100 mL) with Ora-Plus and Ora-Sweet or Ora-Sweet SF 46
   • Weigh 50 mg of methotrexate powder.
   • Combine the methotrexate with 2 mL of glycerin, forming a paste.
