   • Transfer the solution into a plastic prescription bottle.
   • Using either Ora-Sweet or Ora-Sweet SF, add 49 mL in geometric proportions to the
   mixture.
   • Label bottle with "Shake Well Before Use" and "Refrigerate."
   • Refrigerate methotrexate 5 mg/mL for no longer than 14 days

