   Genosyl®

   • Administer using a calibrated Genosyl® Delivery System • Only validated ventilator systems should be used. Keep available a backup power supply to
   address power failures • The delivery system consists of a primary system and a fully functional second system that
   can be used as backup. The delivery system monitors the concentration of nitric oxide, nitro-
   gen dioxide and air; system will shutdown if nitrogen dioxide reaches 3 parts per million (ppm) • The delivery system must be used with antioxidant cartridges not older than 12 months from
   the manufacturing date INOmax®
   Must be administered using a calibrated FDA-cleared nitric oxide delivery system (NODS); refer
