   • Pred Forte® 1%: Indicated for the treatment of steroid-responsive inflammation of the
   palpebral and bulbar conjunctiva, cornea, and anterior segment of the globe • Pred Mild® 12%: Indicated for treatment of mild to moderate noninfectious allergic and in-
