   General Information

   • Rosuvastatin may be taken with or without meals at any time of the day 2 ,4 .

   • Swallow whole 2 ,4 .

   • Missed dose: Do not take an extra dose, resume treatment with the next dose 2
   • Concomitant aluminum and magnesium hydroxide combination antacid: Administer at
   least 2 hours before antacid 2 ,4

   Capsules

   • Do not crush or chew. Capsules may also be opened, emptied, and swallowed along with a
   small amount (1 teaspoon) of soft food, such as applesauce or chocolate/vanilla pudding, with-
   out chewing. Swallow the drug/food mixture within 60 minutes and do not store for future use Nasogastric tube administration of capsules

   • May be taken with or without meals at any time of the day • Attach the syringe containing the granules and 40 mL water to a nasogastric tube (at least 16-
   French) and deliver the contents of the syringe through the nasogastric tube into the stomach • After administering the granules, flush the nasogastric tube with 20 mL of additional water • The mixture must be used immediately after preparation and not be stored for future use. If
   it is not used in its entirety, the remaining mixture should be discarded immediately • Use with any other liquids is not recommended Preparation
