• Continue mixing and gradually add 73 g sorbitol instant.
   • Add reverse osmosis water to the mortar and mix until a pourable mass is achieved.

   • Add reverse osmosis water again to bring to a final volume of 100 mL. Transfer suspension to
   milky high density polyurethane bottle.
   • Label the container with "Shake well before using."

   • Stable for 30 days at room temperature.

