   Acquired toxoplasmosis - HIV co-infection; Treatment

   • Dosage: 25 to 50 mg/kg orally every 6 hours (MAX 1 to 5 g/dose) 2
   • Concomitant medications: Pyrimethamine 2 mg/kg orally once daily for 3 days (MAX 50
