   crease in CD4 count to greater than 200 cells/mm3 for longer than 6 months after initiation of
   combined antiretroviral therapy (cART) Congenital toxoplasmosis

   • Dosage: 50 mg/kg orally every 12 hours for duration of pyrimethamine therapy 1

   • Concomitant medications: Pyrimethamine 1 mg/kg orally every 12 hours for 2 days, fol-
