   eye Cardiovascular: QT interval prolongation and torsades de pointes have been reported Dermatologic: Phototoxicity occurred in 20% of children treated with voriconazole and in 47%
   of children treated for 6 months or longer in a retrospective study (n=430). Associated risk fac-
   tors included white race, cystic fibrosis, cumulative treatment time, and cumulative dose. Out
