   • Triturate twelve 5 mg tablets of ambrisentan to a fine powder using a mortar and pestle.

   • Add approximately 5 mL of glycerin USP to wet the powder and mix into a fine paste.
   • Add approximately 10 mL of Ora-Plus, mix well, and transfer mixture to a 60 mL light resis-
   tant container.
   • Rinse mortar with an additional 20 mL of Ora-Plus and transfer to container.

   • Add approximately 25 mL of Ora-Sweet to container to bring final volume to 60 mL.
   • Label the container with "Shake well before using."

   • Stable for 90 days at room temperature (24 degrees C) or under refrigeration (4 degrees C).', 'Common, pediatric: Anemia, gastrointestinal symptoms, gastroenteritis, headache, na-
