   delamanid, fluoroquinolones), obtain ECG at baseline, 2 weeks, 4 weeks, then every 4 weeks
   during treatment and as clinically indicated; if not feasible, obtain ECG at baseline, 4 weeks, 8
   weeks, and 24 weeks Therapeutic Drug Monitoring (TB)

