• Monitor for clinical (eg, decrease in cough and systemic symptoms, increase in weight), radio-
   logic, and bacteriolo', '• Monitor for clinical (eg, decrease in cough and systemic symptoms, increase in weight), radio-', '• Renal excretion: 65% recovered in urine within 72 hours of a dose 4

