   Oral; severe infection

   • Any age and less than 45 kg: 2 mg/kg orally every 12 hours 1

   • Any age and 45 kg or greater: 100 mg orally every 12 hours 1
   Oral; less severe infection
   • Older than 8 years and less than 45 kg: 4 mg/kg orally in 2 divided doses on day 1 fol-
   lowed by 2 mg/kg/day orally in 1 to 2 divided doses 2 ,3 ,1 ,4

