   • 45 kg or more: 200 mg IV loading dose, then 100 mg IV every 12 hours; switch to oral therapy
   based on clinical improvement 10
   Duration of therapy, postexposure prophylaxis: 60 days for aerosol exposure; 7 days for
   nonaerosol exposure (ie, cutaneous or ingestion) 10

