   50 mg/mL suspension (60 mL) 4
   • Count out and open six 500-mg flucytosine capsules and empty contents into a glass mortar.

   • Mix 30 mL of Ora-Plus with either 30 mL of Ora-Sweet SF or strawberry syrup*. Mix well.
   • Add approximately 15 mL of vehicle mixture to powder and triturate well. Transfer contents
   to a 2-ounce amber prescription bottle.
