   options include a 1:1 mixture of either Ora-Sweet® and Ora-Plus® or a 1:1 mixture of Ora-
   Sweet SF® and Ora-Plus®.

   • Add the vehicle in geometric proportions almost to final volume, mix well, and transfer mix-
