   of action of 6 to 12 hours. Rapid absorption after oral administration with peak attained at 1 to
   2 hours. Plasma levels are increased when given with food. Volume of distribution of 5 L/kg.
   Protein binding is approximately 87%. Undergoes extensive first-pass metabolism by liver and
