   Sweet SF® and Ora-Plus®).
   • Transfer to an amber polyethylene terephthalate prescription bottle.
   • Label bottle with "Shake well before using."

   • Stable for 91 days at controlled room temperature (20 to 25 degrees C) or under refrigeration
   (2 to 8 degrees C). Protect from light.

