   Indicated in the prophylaxis and chronic treatment of asthma in pediatric patients 12 months
   or older, prevention of exercise-induced bronchoconstriction in patients 6 years or older, and
   for the relief of seasonal allergic rhinitis in patients 2 years or older and perennial allergic
   rhinitis in patients 6 months or older In patients with allergic rhinitis, reserve use for patients who have an inadequate response or
   intolerance to alternative therapies, as the benefits may not outweigh the risk of neuropsychi-
   atric symptoms Limitations of Use

   Montelukast is not indicated for the treatment of an acute asthma attack Administration
