   of osteoclasts Distribution: The mean +/- SD body retention of pamidronate was 54 +/- 16% of the dose over
   120 hours Metabolism: Not metabolized Clearance: Exclusively eliminated by the kidneys; total and renal clearances were 107 +/- 50
   mL/min and 49 +/- 28', 'Due to the risk of clinically significant deterioration in renal function, which may progress to renal
   failure, single doses of IV pamidronate should not exceed 60 mg to 1 90 mg (adult maximum dose).
   There must be strict adherence to the IV administration recommendations for pamidronate in order
