   Administration
   Oral tablet: May be taken without regard to food Oral suspension: Prepare by shaking the bottle to loosen the powder. Add the total amount
   of cold water for reconstitution. Replace the cap, invert the bottle, and shake vigorously side to
   side. Once the sound of the powder against the bottle disappears, turn the bottle upright and

vigorously shake in a diagonal direction for at least 1 minute. Wait for 1 hour after reconstitu-
   tion before administering. Shake prior to administration. Take with food Intravenous: May give IV push over 3 to 5 minutes 4 at a concentration of 100 mg/mL For
   intermittent infusion, may further dilute to 1 to 30 mg/mL 4 , 16 in a compatible fluid and give
