  sauce (or at least 1 ounce in children 25 kg or less receiving 1 or 2 capsules or packets) • Draw up mixture in a syringe and with rapid (10 mL/10 seconds) and steady pressure keeping the feeding tube horizon-
  tal, administer the contents into the tube. Repeat until entire mixture is administered 4/9
• Administer within 30 minutes of mixing. Flush tube with a minimum of 10 mL fruit juice or water • Do not save mixture for later use • Administer at least 1 hour before or after medications containing bicarbonate or carbonate • If a dose is missed, take as soon as possible up to 8 hours after the scheduled dose. If the missed dose is within 4 hours
  of the next scheduled dose, skip the missed dose and take the next scheduled dose. Do not take 2 doses at one time to
  make up for the missed dose Ophthalmic

