   • Monitor for radiological changes or new or worsening nonspecific respiratory symptoms (eg,
   hypoxia, pleural effusion, cough, dyspnea) which may indicate non-infectious pneumonitis 1 ,2

   • Monitor for wound-related complications and delayed wound healing 1 , 2

   • Verify pregnancy status in females of reproductive potential prior to initiation of therapy 1 ,2 .', 'Dose adjustments
