   tor, and reduces vascular endothelial growth factor expression 1 ,2 .

   Absorption: Peak concentrations of everolimus were reached 1 to 2 hours after administra-
   tion in patients with advanced solid tumors. Steady state was achieved within 2 weeks follow-
   ing once-daily dosing 1 , Bioavailability: The AUCinf of everolimus was equivalent between everolimus oral tablets and
   everolimus oral tablets for suspension ; however, the Cmax of everolimus was 20% to 36%
   lower for the everolimus oral tablets for suspension compared with everolimus oral tablets
