   Imidazobenzodiazepine that is a benzodiazepine receptor antagonist. Competitively inhibits
   the activity at the benzodiazepine recognition site on the GABA/benzodiazepine receptor.
   Onset of reversal within 1 to 2 minutes with peak effect reached in 6 to 10 minutes when deliv-
   ered intravenously. Duration of action of 20 to 40 minutes. Highly lipid soluble and penetrates
