 ', 'Long- acting beta-agonist (LABA) monotherapy should not be used for long-term control
   of asthma. For pediatric and adolescent asthma patients requiring the addition of a long
   acting beta agonist (LABA) to inhaled corticosteroid (ICS) therapy, use of a fixed-dose
