   an average of less than 1 minute. Permanent hearing loss by 4 years of age was reported in
   17%. The post-intervention population (n=73) was given IV bolus furosemide over 5 to 30 min-
   utes via syringe pump. No patients in this group had permanent hearing loss by 4 years of age Renal

