   Dose Adjustment
   Renal Impairment

   • Creatinine clearance greater than 10 mL/min or similar based on age-appropriate as-
   sessment of renal function: No adjustment necessary 1

   • Creatinine clearance 10 mL/min or less, dialysis, or similar based on age-appropriate
   assessment of renal function: Insufficient data to make dosing recommendations 1
   Hepatic Impairment

   • Mild (Child-Pugh Class A) or moderate (Child-Pugh Class B) impairment: No dosage ad-
   justment required 1

   • Severe (Child-Pugh C) impairment: Use not recommended 1

