   Longitudinal laboratory monitoring is not recommended in otherwise healthy infants receiving
   currently recommended therapies for prophylaxis in the first 6 weeks of life 1
   Periodic monitoring of hematologic and liver toxicity in breastfeeding infants receiving prophy-
   laxis beyond the first 6 weeks of life and for extended durations 1

