   Hepatic impairment

• Liver test abnormalities or symptoms of hepatitis: Prior to initiating therapy, establish
   baseline liver tests and monitor during therapy to identify signs of liver injury. Interrupt ther-
   apy if liver test abnormalities occur or symptoms of clinical hepatitis are observed • Restarting therapy: Consider restarting therapy at lowest dose of 40 mcg/kg and increase
