   value. Discontinue if liver test abnormalities recur • Hepatic decompensation event (eg, variceal hemorrhage, ascites, hepatic en-
   cephalopathy, or portal hypertension): Permanently discontinue Adverse Events:
   • Diarrhea: Interrupt dosing if a patient experiences persistent diarrhea. Restart at 40
