       sion may be required
   ●   Refractory Events:
   ●   Hyaluronidase 15 units intradermally along injection site and edematous area. Give as five, 2 mL intradermal injections
       along extravasation site and edematous tissue.
   ●   Inadvertent Intraarterial Administration:
   ●   Leave inadvertent intraarterial line in place for diagnostics
