   the navel. A caregiver may also administer in the outer area of the patient''s arm • Do not inject into skin that is tender, damaged, bruised or scarred. Do not inject intra-
   venously Preparation
   • Remove from refrigerator and allow to reach room temperature for at least 30 minutes. If the
   dose is already stored at room temperature, it is ready for use • Do not shake the vial or the prefilled syringe at any time

