   Note: A 2 mg/mL oral concentrate is commercially available.

   1 mg/mL oral suspension (300 mL) with SyrSpend® SF PH4 27 :
   • Weigh out 300 mg lorazepam active pharmaceutical ingredient. Triturate to a fine powder us-
   ing a mortar and pestle.

   • Add a small amount of SyrSpend® SF PH4 to wet the powder and mix into a fine paste.
   • Continue to add SyrSpend® SF PH4 in geometric proportions, mixing after each addition, to
   bring final volume to 300 mL.

   • Transfer mixture to a low-actinic light-resistant container.
   • Label the container with "Shake well before using."

   • Stable for 60 days at room temperature (20 to 25°C) or 90 days under refrigeration (2 to 8°C).

