   lipid parameters, and fat mass in a randomized trial of non-obese girls born SGA with PP

(n=38; mean age 8 years) Continued reductions in these same parameters were seen after
   an additional 2 years on metFORMIN 850 mg daily Two years after treatment was discontin-
   ued, differences in androgen levels, fasting insulin levels, lipid profiles, and fat mass were
