   Postoperative pulmonary hypertension in combination with nitric oxide in children under-
   going cardiac surgery. In studies of children with pulmonary hypertension after cardiac proce-
   dures (eg, Fontan procedure), combination therapy with milrinone and nitric oxide was more
   effective than therapy with either alone. Decreased pulmonary artery pressure, reduction in
   pulmonary vascular resistance, and stabilization of pulmonary hemodynamics have been asso-
