   Ensure®, or Advera® within 1 hour of dosing may improve taste. Use a calibrated dosing sy-
   ringe for administration of oral solution Before administration of oral solution, give ice
   chips, a popsicle, or spoonfuls of partially frozen orange or grape juice concentrate to dull the
   taste buds or give peanut butter to coat the mouth. After administration, give strong tasting
   foods such as maple syrup, or cheese Oral solution contains ethanol and propylene glycol and is not recommended for use with
   polyurethane feeding tubes due to potential incompatibility. Feeding tubes comprised of sili-
