   Rates
   First infusion

   •Administer IV at an initial rate of 5 mg/kg/hr 2 (maximum 50 mg/hr) 2 ,20

   •If no infusion reactions occur after 1 hour 2 , rate may be escalated by 5 mg/kg/hr 2 (maxi-
