   •Initiate at rate of 1 mg/kg/hr 2 (maximum 100 mg/hr) 2 ,20 if the previous infusion was toler-
   ated; otherwise, administer at a rate used in the first infusion • If infusion is well-tolerated after 1 hour, then rate may be escalated by 1 mg/kg/hr 2 (maxi-
   mum 100 mg/hr increments) at 30-minute intervals to a maximum of 400 mg/hr 2 ,20

   •Slow or interrupt infusion if an infusion reaction develops. Treatment may be resumed at 50%
   of the previous rate upon improvement of symptoms 20
