specifically at the spinal level to cause muscle relaxation. It inhibits both monosynaptic and', 'Pharmacology
   Mechanism of action:Baclofen is a derivative of gamma aminobutyric acid (GABA) and acts
   specifically at the spinal level to cause muscle relaxation. It inhibits both monosynaptic and
