   • Never use single-use vials more than once or for more than 1 patient; discard unused por-
   tions to avoid transmission of bloodborne pathogens 4

   • May administer bolus doses via small veins if pretreated with lidocaine 4

   • Do not administer as a rapid bolus to debilitated or America Society of Anesthesiologists
   Physical Status (ASA-PS) III or IV patients as this increases risk of cardiorespiratory events 4

   • Flush the IV line every 12 hours and at the end of the anesthetic procedure 4

