   ness in throat, angioneurotic edema, cyanosis, pulmonary edema, and hemorrhage into the GI
   tract have been reported. Tenderness and induration has been reported following IM use Rare: Hypersensitivity or life-threatening anaphylactic reaction following IV administration, es-
   pecially after repeated injections Monitoring
