(951, 'Sucrose', 'antibiotic', TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 100, '2 mL of 12% to 30% sucrose solution 2 minutes prior to the procedure 1 ,2 ,3 ,4 ,5 ,6 ,7 .', 'Mild analgesia and behavioral comforting prior to painful procedures (eg, vaccination, heel
